		{"id":"myc__myc_film_catE","type":"group","x":1300,"y":14421,"width":2070,"height":596,"color":"5","label":"🔵 克制无结算型"},
		{"id":"myc__myc_film_catF","type":"group","x":2840,"y":14885,"width":3730,"height":266,"label":"⬜ 待裁决（链型未定）"},
		{"id":"myc__myc_film_catdefF","type":"text","text":"**F｜待裁决（1部）**\n链型本身尚未定（双候选待 USER 裁决），不预归任何一类。","x":2870,"y":14941,"width":470,"height":170},
		{"id":"myc__myc_film_14","type":"text","text":"**⑭《爱在黎明破晓前》(1995)** WATCH-014\n一夜时限与未知重逢\n杰西 **Z?**／席琳 **NZ?** 双候选，非正式盲测\n【H；待USER裁决灵魂核】","x":6070,"y":14947,"width":470,"height":174},
